Petit Clover!

00:23:15.930 --> 00:23:19.930
<b>Asta
 VS
The Anti-Birds!</b>

00:23:16.710 --> 00:23:19.250
Asta vs. the Anti-Birds.

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:21.720
Ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:24.810
Hey! Get away from me! Buzz off!

00:23:25.250 --> 00:23:27.690
Whoa! Hey! What the heck are you guys doing?!

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:31.280
Unbelievable...

00:23:29.600 --> 00:23:34.200
Hey, Yuno! Ow, ow, ow! Help me!

00:23:35.770 --> 00:23:38.910
Oh, crap! I haven't really
done much up to this point!

00:23:38.910 --> 00:23:40.830
But I'm not done yet! I can still do this!

00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:43.250
Aku akan lolos, apa pun yang terjadi!

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:46.920
